     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2014-07-31 16:31 GMT+03:00 Jonathan Rosenblatt <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">john...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span>:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">חילקת את המובהקויות ב- 10?</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">\r\n\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2014-07-31 16:29 GMT+03:00 משה אבאייב <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bgb...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span>:<div><div><br>\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\"><div dir=\"rtl\"><div><br></div>זה לא נותן את אותה תוצאה כמו בSPSS<div>משער שאולי הבעיה שזה לא לפי Bonferroni <div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<br></div><div><br></div><div>בתאריך יום חמישי, 31 ביולי 2014 14:21:52 UTC+3, מאת Tal Galili:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">smokers  &lt;- c( 83, 90, 129, 70 )\r\npatients &lt;- c( 86, 93, 136, 82 )\r\npairwise.prop.test(smokers, patients)</pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></pre></div></div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>----------------Contact Details:----------------------<u></u>------------------------------<u></u>---<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nContact me: <a rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a> |  <br><div>Read me: <a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497855189000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ZfvRrQzVvMfm84w44d7SJ\">www.talgalili.com</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497855189000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Mjo8dtra8fNiTE9C9cp55\">www.biostatistics.co.il</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-statistics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497855189000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3VsvVuZbP2hj1qy96fb48T\">www.r-statistics.com</a> (English)<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n------------------------------<u></u>------------------------------<u></u>------------------------------<u></u>----<br><br></div></div></div>\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2014-07-31 14:18 GMT+03:00 משה אבאייב <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">bgb...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span>:<div><div><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\">יש לך דוגמה שמסבירה את זה? <div><br></div><div>וזה לא ממש דומה לתוצאות של SPSS <br>בתאריך יום רביעי, 30 ביולי 2014 11:52:20 UTC+3, מאת Jonathan Rosenblatt:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">האם pairwise.prop.test יתאים?</div></div><div><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Jul 30, 2014 at 11:22 AM, משה אבאייב :<div><br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\"><div dir=\"rtl\"><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">אני מנסה כבר כמה שבועות למצוא פתרון דומה ב R כמו שקיים בSPPS. </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">מצרף קישור לדוגמה מSPSS.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www-01.ibm.com/support/knowledgecenter/api/content/SSLVMB_20.0.0/com.ibm.spss.statistics.help/sig_tests_colprop_ex.htm\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www-01.ibm.com/support/knowledgecenter/api/content/SSLVMB_20.0.0/com.ibm.spss.statistics.help/sig_tests_colprop_ex.htm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497855189000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1g5vHYCKuSXIgjPxIhE7d3\">http://www-01.ibm.com/support/<u></u><u></u><u></u>knowledgecenter/api/content/<u></u>SS<u></u><u></u>LVMB_20.0.0/com.ibm.spss.<u></u>stati<u></u><u></u>stics.help/sig_tests_<u></u>colprop_<u></u>e<u></u>x.htm</a><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><div><br></div><div>תודה רבה </div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div>משה </div><div><br></div></font></span></div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Israel R User Group&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-user-group+<u></u>unsubscrib<u></u>e...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n\r\n\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497855189000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0hxdJILlH7amBHusqzu60d\">https://groups.google.com/d/<u></u>op<u></u>tout</a>.<br>\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div></div><br><br clear=\"all\"><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div>-- <br>Jonathan Rosenblatt<br><a href=\"http://www.john-ros.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.john-ros.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497855189000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3_V0gQ2P4hnMn15rKhQD89\">w